      "name": "Primary download",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "The standard cobalt action links to installation.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-button\" href=\"#download\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v12\"/><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"/><path d=\"M5 17v4h14v-4\"/></svg><span>Download for macOS</span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;padding:13px 20px;min-height:46px;border-radius:var(--radius,8px);font:550 15px/1.55 Onest,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;text-decoration:none;background:var(--blue,#213b8e);color:var(--paper,#fff);transition:background .15s;}.ds-button:hover{background:var(--blue-hover,#172e75);}.ds-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #3865df;outline-offset:5px;}.ds-button svg{flex-shrink:0;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Large download",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-large",
      "description": "The main installation action uses larger text and padding.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-button ds-large\" href=\"#download\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v12\"/><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"/><path d=\"M5 17v4h14v-4\"/></svg><span>Download for macOS</span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;padding:13px 20px;min-height:46px;border-radius:var(--radius,8px);font:550 15px/1.55 Onest,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;text-decoration:none;background:var(--blue,#213b8e);color:var(--paper,#fff);transition:background .15s;}.ds-button:hover{background:var(--blue-hover,#172e75);}.ds-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #3865df;outline-offset:5px;}.ds-button svg{flex-shrink:0;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button{transition:none;}}.ds-large{font-size:18px;padding:17px 24px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Comparison playback controls",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-play",
      "description": "Playback and manual controls precede the comparison. Previous starts disabled, and Next disables on the fifth frame; the source script supplies state changes.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-playback\"><div class=\"ds-playback-buttons\"><button class=\"ds-icon ds-play\" type=\"button\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m8 5 11 7-11 7V5Z\"/></svg><span>Play</span></button><button class=\"ds-icon ds-previous\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Previous step\" title=\"Previous step\" disabled><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-icon\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next step\" title=\"Next step\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 5 10 7-10 7V5Z\"/><path d=\"M19 5v14\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-icon\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Restart explanation\" title=\"Restart explanation\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 10a9 9 0 1 1 2.7 8.4\"/><path d=\"M3 4v6h6\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"ds-step-copy\"><span class=\"ds-step-count\">1 / 5</span><p><strong>A starts; B is waiting</strong><span>A owns the only slot. Its worker operation is still pending.</span></p></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;min-width:36px;min-height:36px;border:0;background:transparent;border-radius:6px;color:var(--blue,#213b8e);font:400 13px/1.55 Onest,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;}.ds-icon:hover:not(:disabled){background:#dce7ff;}.ds-icon:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #3865df;outline-offset:5px;}.ds-icon:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default;}.ds-play{border:1px solid #aebddc;padding:7px 12px;min-width:81px;background:var(--paper,#fff);}.ds-play:hover{background:#dce7ff;}.ds-playback{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:23px;min-height:90px;padding:12px 0;font:400 16px/1.55 Onest,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#1e2537);}.ds-playback-buttons{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;flex-shrink:0;}.ds-previous svg{transform:rotate(180deg);}.ds-step-copy{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:13px;min-width:0;}.ds-step-count{font-size:12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--muted,#52617e);}.ds-step-copy p{margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;}.ds-step-copy strong{display:block;font-weight:600;}.ds-step-copy p>span{color:var(--muted,#52617e);}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-playback{display:block;min-height:150px;}.ds-step-copy{margin-top:12px;min-height:92px;}.ds-step-copy p{font-size:13px;}}"
